          "titulo": "Modais e perfect na passiva",
          "explicacao": "PASSO 1: com modais, use «modal + be + particípio»: «The report must be submitted by Friday.», «This can be done online.» PASSO 2: negativa: «The door mustn't be left open.» PASSO 3: com o present perfect, use «has/have been + particípio»: «The package has been delivered.», «All the tickets have been sold.» PASSO 4: pergunta: «Has the package been delivered?», «Can it be fixed?» PASSO 5: o resultado importa agora: «The window has been broken» (e continua quebrada). PASSO 6: regra e aviso: «Visitors must be accompanied by staff.»",
